write the code.\n\nEdge case: refinement may not cover all nodes in edges? But likely all nodes appear. We'll assume all nodes in edges are in refinement.\n\nSorting: default string sorting is fine.\n\nReturn dictionary.\n\nNow produce final JSON."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1482,"completion_tokens":982,"total_tokens":2464,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1408},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":684},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1408,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":74},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}